1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Tutorial 1: Quick Add on a phone. Start on Home. Quick Add
is in the bar near the bottom of Home.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,417
Tap Quick Add. Tap it. The camera opens.

3
00:00:09,417 --> 00:00:17,417
First time only: Allow the camera. Your phone asks to use
the camera. Choose Allow. It may say While using the app. If
you chose Block, allow the camera in your browser's site
settings, then reopen Quick Add.

4
00:00:17,417 --> 00:00:21,917
Universe. Choose the type of collectible. This is optional.

5
00:00:21,917 --> 00:00:26,417
Category. Narrow it down if you want. Also optional.

6
00:00:26,417 --> 00:00:30,917
Take the photo. Tap the round button to photograph an item.

7
00:00:30,917 --> 00:00:36,084
One photo per item. Repeat for each item. When you are done,
tap Finished.

8
00:00:36,084 --> 00:00:41,501
Or use the small picture. The small picture at the bottom
left opens the review too.

9
00:00:41,501 --> 00:00:47,584
Check your photos. Every photo is listed. Scroll to find a
bad shot and tap Remove.

10
00:00:47,584 --> 00:00:54,251
Fix a category. Item 3 is a toy, but it says TCG. Change its
Universe and Category here.

11
00:00:54,251 --> 00:01:00,334
Check the category. Each item has its own Universe and
Category. Fix any that are wrong.

12
00:01:00,334 --> 00:01:07,334
Name each item. Type a name for each item. An item with no
name is saved as Untitled Item.

13
00:01:07,334 --> 00:01:11,251
Save. Tap Save 3 items to Vault.

14
00:01:11,251 --> 00:01:17,668
Saved. You land in your Vault. Items now shows 3. Scroll
down to see them.

15
00:01:17,668 --> 00:01:25,668
Recap: You used Quick Add. Open Quick Add from Home. One
photo per item, then Finished. Remove bad photos, fix
categories, name your items. Save, then find them in your
Vault.
